{
    "name": "dsh-model-fold",
    "version": "0.5.1",
    "description": "模型选择器按来源分组：默认悬停来源即在右侧滑出该来源的模型，当前模型与来源一眼可见；菜单底部设置条可切换 悬浮 / 面板 / 列表 三种模式并调字号。| Group the DSH model picker by provider: hovering a source slides its models out (default), the active source and model are visible at a glance, and an in-menu bar switches between hover / panel / inline modes and font size.",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "./lib/index.js",
    "exports": {
        ".": "./lib/index.js",
        "./client": "./lib/client.js",
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "files": [
        "lib/*.js",
        "cordis.patch.yml",
        "README.md",
        "CHANGELOG.md",
        "LICENSE",
        "docs/modes.md",
        "docs/images/**"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "keywords": [
        "dsh-plugin",
        "deepseek-harness",
        "model-selection",
        "ui"
    ],
    "dsh": {
        "bundle": {
            "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
        },
        "client": {
            "platform": "web",
            "inject": []
        }
    },
    "engines": {
        "node": ">=18",
        "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
    },
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-model-fold.git"
    },
    "peerDependencies": {
        "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
    },
    "devDependencies": {
        "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
    }
}
